  "description": "Let's welcome a new comer to the 2019 line with the Double Peak Trail Plus model, which offers 27.5\" Plus tire comfort, traction and a whole lot of fun in a slightly more affordable package (compared to the DP Comp Plus) with an almost complete 2x9 Shimano Acera / Alivio group, a new Suntour XCT-30 fork with 100mm of travel and a SR XCM crankset. The parts package is completed by a new Shimano MT-200 hydraulic brake set for fun and safe riding on the trails.\nDouble Peak 27.5\" 6000 Series alloy frame w/ internal routing\nNew Suntour XCT-30, 100mm travel fork w/ hydraulic Lockout\nSuntour XCM crankset, 36/22T, 2x9, w/ sealed cartridge BB\nShimano Alivio M4020-M, 2x9 front pull derailleur\nShimano Acera 9-spd RD-M3000 rear derailleur\nShimano Acera SL-M3000 shifters\nShimano HG-200 9-spd 11-36T cassette\nXD-155 Disc alloy DW rims, 32mm wide\nNew Shimano MT-200 hydraulic disc brakeset, Center Lock",
